{"type":"tool_execution_update","toolCallId":"call_b8510ab2c3c74c62847a745c","toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"cd /var/home/sasha/para/areas/dev/gh/charly/evallerina && git show c4409f7","timeout":30},"partialResult":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"commit c4409f7101c42f9b8f50d929752acc46c2b8b073\nAuthor: charly vibes <charly.vibes@proton.me>\nDate:   Mon Oct 19 16:11:58 2026 -0300\n\n    evallerina-bhh: route archetype scenarios through scenario_channel\n    \n    Rotation eligibility (evallerina-bhh step 2): every live_scenarios()\n    entry must resolve a routing channel before rotation day — the archetype\n    family mappings join scenario_channel: vampiro-polyglot-seam → envelope\n    (gate/guidance JSON envelope probes), wai-drifted-ecosystem → artifact\n    (stale-AGENTS.md probe via doc_drift_blindness, matching its doc-drift\n    siblings). Explicit resolution tests pin both names so the dashboard\n    never errors on an unknown scenario.\n\ndiff --git a/src/report.rs b/src/report.rs\nindex 698543b..4996c98 100644\n--- a/src/report.rs\n+++ b/src/report.rs\n@@ -141,6 +141,12 @@ pub fn scenario_channel(name: &str) -> Option<&'static str> {\n         | \"dont-hint-adherence-lifecycle\" => Some(\"envelope\"),\n         \"wai-hint-adherence-typo\" => Some(\"suggestions\"),\n         \"wai-doc-drift-stale-agents-md\" | \"dont-doc-drift-stale-lifecycle\" => Some(\"artifact\"),\n+        // Archetype family (evallerina-bhh): vampiro-polyglot-seam asserts\n+        // on vampiro's gate/guidance JSON envelopes; wai-drifted-ecosystem\n+        // probes the stale-AGENTS.md artifact via doc_drift_blindness,\n+        // mapping to `artifact` like its doc-drift siblings.\n+        \"vampiro-polyglot-seam\" => Some(\"envelope\"),\n+        \"wai-drifted-ecosystem\" => Some(\"artifact\"),\n         _ => None,\n     }\n }\ndiff --git a/tests/evals_replay.rs b/tests/evals_replay.rs\nindex 279415b..f06ec00 100644\n--- a/tests/evals_replay.rs\n+++ b/tests/evals_replay.rs